        "Hospital.1": " ।        ।",
        "Hospital.2": "  ।     ।",
        "Hospital.3": "       ।  ,            ।",
        "Hospital.4": "     ?     ?       ।^(   ।     ,  ,   ,   ,    ।    (   ),           ।) ",
